"Convento colonial que guarda banderas tomadas en las Invasiones Inglesas y el mausoleo de Manuel Belgrano en el atrio.": "A colonial convent that keeps flags captured during the British Invasions and the mausoleum of Manuel Belgrano in its forecourt.",
"Una de las iglesias más antiguas del centro, con un convento de patio colonial al lado.": "One of the oldest churches in the centre, with a convent with a colonial courtyard next door.",
